{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;The proposed development results in the loss of a large family-sized dwellinghouse, the need for which is clearly demonstrated in the development plan and supporting evidence base. While it would provide a dwelling in the form of an HMO, it fails to demonstrate that there&amp;nbsp;is an identified need. As such, the proposal is considered to have a detrimental impact on the borough&#x27;s supply of family housing and is contrary to the following policies:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework (December 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Policies D6 and H9 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Policies DMH5 and SP3 of the Barking and Dagenham Local Plan 2037 (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;The quality of the communal habitable rooms is inadequate thus would result in the provision of sub-standard accommodation&amp;nbsp;which is contrary to the following policies:-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Policy D6 and Table 3.1 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Policy DMH5 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037 (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Housing Design Standards LPG (June 2023)-&amp;nbsp;East London HMO Guidance (4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;-DCLG Technical Housing Standards (nationally described space standard) (DCLG, March 2015) (as amended)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;The proposed HMO has the potential to increase activity level and coming and goings to and from the site leading to additional levels of noise and disturbance at the property. The proposal is therefore likely to have a negative impact on neighbouring amenity in this street of family housing and in turn the health and wellbeing of neighbouring residents. As such the proposal is contrary to the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;- Policies D6, D14 and GG3 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;- Policies DMD1, DMH5 and DMSI3 of the Local Plan (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
